  "description": "The native payload for Agora's facial expression capture extension, staged out of the AgoraRtcEngine_macOS 4.7.0 archive and packaged for .NET for macOS. Tracks facial expression coefficients from the camera, for driving an avatar rather than sending the camera image itself. Add it alongside Net.Agora.Video.Mac or Net.Agora.Voice.Mac — it carries no managed API of its own; the switch that turns it on is AgoraRtcEngineKit's face-info observer in the RTC binding.",
